


   =====( ClickIt V1.00 )=============================================


        Trion 'Clickit' Utilities.

        (c) Copyright Paul Spijkerman, '96-'97. All rights reserved.

        Written for use with the Trion BBS package.


   ===================================================================


   The clickit tools are basically a couple of windows with
   buttons in them to start all types of actions.

   Clickit 0 starts scripts, shows logs, and gives commands.
   Clickit 1 Edits configs.

   The clickit tools can be started with a few arguments on
   the command line, to change the position on the screen and
   to change the default editor (CED).

   WINDOW <xpos> <ypos>
   EDITOR <path/name>


   When clickit is run it will open on the default public
   screen (probably the workbench).
   Except when the TrionRM screen is open, it will op it's
   window on the public screen of TrionRM.
   Note that you have to close the window of clickit manually
   before TrionRM can iconize .. if you iconize TrionRM
   without closing them the whole BBS system will halt and
   wait until you close the windows.


   Note that the clickit Utils are obsolete by now .. because
   there is the GuiMod programm with should be better.
   But the Clickit tools have a little advantage because
   they can run when TrionRM isn't running. Which is something
   what guimod can't do.


